 ll”][vc_column_text] On Saturday\, 3rd of October from 2pm \, join us at
  RQAS Brisbane Gallery for the Opening Event and prize presentation for th
 e inaugural Audrey Gibbs Art Prize! For this event nibbles will be provide
 d and drinks available for purchase. There will also be live music! We loo
 k forward to seeing you at the gallery for an enjoyable evening of art\, n
 ibbles and drinks\, and to be the first to hear the prize presentations. T
 icket prices: RQAS Brisbane Branch Members: $5 Non-Members: $15 Make sure 
 to secure your ticket via the link below soon as numbers are limited! Plea
 se note : This event will be held in the main gallery which is wheelchair 
 accessible.[/vc_column_text][vc_raw_html]JTNDJTIxLS0lMjBBZGQlMjB0aGUlMjBmb
